' Activity Diagram 05 — Estimator::tips evaluation flow + the hardened seams.
'
' The fork-choice evaluation flow (casper/src/rust/estimator.rs) with the four
' low-severity robustness fixes annotated:
'   B1: weight_from_validator_by_dag returns a typed KvStoreError on a missing
'       parent (no panic) — proto_util.rs.
'   B2: parent cap is cast-safe — < 0 or i32::MAX means "all", else take n.
'   B3: build_scores_map accumulates with checked_add (supply-cap guard).
'   B4: filter_deep_parents surfaces a typed Err on an empty tip set
'       (genesis-only DAG) instead of panicking.
'
' NOTE on node coloring in THIS PlantUML build: the correct form is the suffix
' stereotype  ':label; <<#hex>>'  (verified by rendering); the prefix form
' '#hex:label;' emits a deprecation banner and leaves the node uncolored.
'
' Source of truth for the B1–B4 fixes (section 3) in
' docs/casper/theory/fork-choice/fork-choice-verification.md.
'
' Render:
'   plantuml -tsvg docs/casper/theory/fork-choice/diagrams/05-activity-estimator-flow.puml

@startuml 05-activity-estimator-flow
!theme plain

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor        #FFFFFF
  BorderColor            #333333
  ArrowColor             #444444
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  DiamondBorderColor     #E65100
}
skinparam legendFontName "monospace"
skinparam legendFontSize 10
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #666666
skinparam defaultFontName "monospace"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title Fork-choice evaluation flow ── certified two-lane LMD-GHOST

' Node color legend (suffix <<#hex>> form):
'   blue     (#BBDEFB) = read / setup step
'   lavender (#D1C4E9) = slashing filter (T-10)
'   mint     (#C8E6C9) = scoring step
'   orange   (#FFE0B2) = greedy head + concurrent terminal frontier
'   tan      (#D7CCC8) = bounds / truncation
'   red      (#FFCDD2) = typed-error outcome (B4)
'   green    (#A5D6A7) = final ForkChoice
'   amber diamond (#FFF8E1) = decision

start
:read complete certified eligible slots; <<#D1C4E9>>
:calculate_lca over every eligible message; <<#BBDEFB>>
:build_scores_map — BFS to LCA,\nchecked_add score (B3); <<#C8E6C9>>
note right #FFECB3
  B1: weight_from_validator_by_dag
  returns a typed KvStoreError on a
  MISSING parent (no panic).
end note
:greedy_ghost_head — choose the maximum-score\nchild at each level; validate height progress; <<#FFE0B2>>
:terminal_frontier — expand every scored branch\nunder arbitrary order; deduplicate shared children; <<#FFE0B2>>
:rank_forkchoices — require head membership;\nhead ++ score/hash-sorted remaining terminals; <<#FFE0B2>>

if (tips empty? (genesis-only DAG)) then (yes ── B4)
  :typed Err\n(filter_deep_parents empty guard); <<#FFCDD2>>
  kill
else (no)
  :filter_deep_parents\n(max_parent_depth); <<#D7CCC8>>
  :cap parents — unlimited\n(i32::MAX or −1) ⟹ all,\nelse take n (B2 cast-safe); <<#D7CCC8>>
  :ForkChoice { tips, lca }; <<#A5D6A7>>
  stop
endif

legend bottom
  Every step is a PURE function of (DAG, certified context), so all honest nodes
  compute a node-identical ForkChoice (Rocq fork_choice_determinism_correct).
  The empty-tips case is a typed Err, NOT a panic (Bound.empty_tips_typed_err);
  the parent cap is cast-safe (B2); score accumulation is checked_add (B3);
  and a missing parent surfaces a typed KvStoreError, never a panic (B1).
endlegend

@enduml
